    %% Training Flow Diagram
    CelebA[CelebA Dataset: Photos & Attributes] --> Pre[Data Preprocessing]
    FFHQ[FFHQ Dataset: High-res Photos] --> Pre
    
    Pre --> NLPTrain[Train NLP Extractor / Parser]
    Pre --> GenTrain[Train Generator: StyleGAN2/Diffusion]
    
    NLPTrain --> NLPWeights[NLP Model Weights]
    GenTrain --> GenWeights[Generator Weights]
    
    NLPWeights --> Target[Target Attribute Mapping]
    GenWeights --> Target
    
    style CelebA fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style FFHQ fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n